    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622010/extras/bb089ac1e1b15592e3788d6f7e670edc.poster.avif?t=1741588441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622010/extras/bb089ac1e1b15592e3788d6f7e670edc.webm?t=1741588441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622010/extras/bb089ac1e1b15592e3788d6f7e670edc.mp4?t=1741588441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Castle Greyrot is a <strong>tactical rogue-lite RPG</strong> that blends <strong>adventure and boss rush</strong> elements into a thrilling experience. Expect the classic rogue-like mechanics\u2014<strong>randomized stages, powerful loot, battle-altering curses, brutal bosses, and meaningful choices</strong>\u2014but with one major twist: <strong>your progress is permanent</strong>. Keep your <strong>hard-earned gear, unique heroes, and upgrades</strong> as you fight your way through the ever-changing Castle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Living, Breathing Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Legends say Castle Greyrot is alive, shifting its location every ten years and corrupting everything in its path. Filled with <strong>deadly traps, hidden treasures, and relentless foes</strong>, the Castle lures adventurers inside\u2014only to <strong>feed on their souls</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summoned as an <strong>experienced Commander</strong>, it\u2019s your mission to lead a team of mercenaries into the depths of the Castle and <strong>eradicate the unknown evil lurking within</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622010/extras/b39a201a7ec07f3dd41469f40f434adf.avif?t=1741588441\" /></div><br><br>\ud83d\udee1 <strong>Class-Based Tactical RPG</strong> \u2013 Choose from <strong>16 unique classes</strong>, starting with the <strong>Cleric, Thief, Warrior, and Wizard</strong>. And yes, our returning hero, the <strong>Time Mage</strong>, is here too! Build the perfect <strong>three-person squad</strong> to face the Castle\u2019s horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Unlockable Classes</strong> \u2013 Progress by mastering your current classes and uncovering the Castle\u2019s secrets to unlock <strong>12 additional classes</strong> with diverse playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Secrets to Uncover</strong> \u2013 Each class has <strong>unique skills and perks</strong> that can help you unveil the Castle\u2019s deepest mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Randomized Encounters</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same. Expect <strong>alternative paths, dynamic events, and unpredictable boss battles</strong>. Watch out for <strong>DEADLY traps and mimic chests hungry for your arms!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Rogue-Lite Experience</strong> \u2013 No permadeath. <strong>Retry battles until you conquer them</strong>\u2014or rage quit. Experiment with different <strong>class combinations and strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Permanent Progression</strong> \u2013 Every time your party returns from a successful <strong>boss-killing expedition</strong>, you\u2019ll be able to <strong>enhance your stats and grow stronger</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcca <strong>Non-Linear Leveling</strong> \u2013 Forget grinding! Instead of XP, we use a <strong>task-based progression system</strong>. Complete <strong>class-specific challenges</strong> to level up and unlock new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Boss Rush Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Castle Greyrot is all about <strong>boss fights</strong>. Each stage pits you against <strong>1 to 2 powerful bosses</strong>, with over <strong>50 unique encounters</strong> waiting to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you conquer the ever-shifting Castle Greyrot? Or will you become just another lost soul in its endless cycle of corruption?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622010/extras/bb089ac1e1b15592e3788d6f7e670edc.poster.avif?t=1741588441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622010/extras/bb089ac1e1b15592e3788d6f7e670edc.webm?t=1741588441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622010/extras/bb089ac1e1b15592e3788d6f7e670edc.mp4?t=1741588441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Castle Greyrot is a <strong>tactical rogue-lite RPG</strong> that blends <strong>adventure and boss rush</strong> elements into a thrilling experience. Expect the classic rogue-like mechanics\u2014<strong>randomized stages, powerful loot, battle-altering curses, brutal bosses, and meaningful choices</strong>\u2014but with one major twist: <strong>your progress is permanent</strong>. Keep your <strong>hard-earned gear, unique heroes, and upgrades</strong> as you fight your way through the ever-changing Castle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Living, Breathing Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Legends say Castle Greyrot is alive, shifting its location every ten years and corrupting everything in its path. Filled with <strong>deadly traps, hidden treasures, and relentless foes</strong>, the Castle lures adventurers inside\u2014only to <strong>feed on their souls</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summoned as an <strong>experienced Commander</strong>, it\u2019s your mission to lead a team of mercenaries into the depths of the Castle and <strong>eradicate the unknown evil lurking within</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622010/extras/b39a201a7ec07f3dd41469f40f434adf.avif?t=1741588441\" /></div><br><br>\ud83d\udee1 <strong>Class-Based Tactical RPG</strong> \u2013 Choose from <strong>16 unique classes</strong>, starting with the <strong>Cleric, Thief, Warrior, and Wizard</strong>. And yes, our returning hero, the <strong>Time Mage</strong>, is here too! Build the perfect <strong>three-person squad</strong> to face the Castle\u2019s horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Unlockable Classes</strong> \u2013 Progress by mastering your current classes and uncovering the Castle\u2019s secrets to unlock <strong>12 additional classes</strong> with diverse playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Secrets to Uncover</strong> \u2013 Each class has <strong>unique skills and perks</strong> that can help you unveil the Castle\u2019s deepest mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Randomized Encounters</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same. Expect <strong>alternative paths, dynamic events, and unpredictable boss battles</strong>. Watch out for <strong>DEADLY traps and mimic chests hungry for your arms!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Rogue-Lite Experience</strong> \u2013 No permadeath. <strong>Retry battles until you conquer them</strong>\u2014or rage quit. Experiment with different <strong>class combinations and strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Permanent Progression</strong> \u2013 Every time your party returns from a successful <strong>boss-killing expedition</strong>, you\u2019ll be able to <strong>enhance your stats and grow stronger</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcca <strong>Non-Linear Leveling</strong> \u2013 Forget grinding! Instead of XP, we use a <strong>task-based progression system</strong>. Complete <strong>class-specific challenges</strong> to level up and unlock new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Boss Rush Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Castle Greyrot is all about <strong>boss fights</strong>. Each stage pits you against <strong>1 to 2 powerful bosses</strong>, with over <strong>50 unique encounters</strong> waiting to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you conquer the ever-shifting Castle Greyrot? Or will you become just another lost soul in its endless cycle of corruption?</p>",
    "short_description": "Castle Greyrot is a tactical boss-rush rogue-lite RPG where brutal battles await at every turn. Train your party, master powerful abilities, and face the horrors of the ever-changing Castle. Can you break its unending curse\u2026 or will you fall like the rest?",
    "supported_languages": "English, Turkish",
    "reviews": "\u201cChallenging is a word that pops up constantly when talking about this game, whether from the developer point of view, streamers, or reviewers. This isn\u2019t a bad thing as the satisfaction that you feel when you make even the smallest bit of progress is unreal.\u201d<br>Beta Tested, Game Reviewed<br>",
